  "data_availability_text": "Data availabilityKnowledge graphs were generated using the EpiSwitch 3D-Genomics large language model (LLM), which employs a unique embedding approach. This platform integrates advanced semantic parsing with over 1.5 billion experimentally-verified 3D genome interactions. Leveraging proprietary AI models trained on chromatin architecture, it enables mapping of regulatory circuitry, identification of causal mechanisms, and prediction of the effects of non-coding and structural variants within their native 3D genomic context. These tools are deployed on Google Cloud in collaboration with Google. Data is available on request https://www.oxfordbiodynamics.com/contact-us#contact-us-form-wrapper.",
